        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d16ceb94045a457197636ee520354cf6",
      "statement": "The rhc setup tooling consists of two files: rhc.setup.ts configures the accounts plugin (registration, verification, password reset, OAuth, team invitations) and CORS origin allowlist, while rhc.setup.consents.ts extends it with a consents gate for Terms of Service and Privacy Policy acceptance.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rhc.setup.consents.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:9e307ef91e62541e441ca54443242909604599ca316a36b4fc613033371ae843"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://rhc.setup.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:c30b047316419d0743af58d9c3eb6e88708eb457443db1fb8092f697f4c8c9fa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_eb2dc768dd47409facd82713be23e22f",
      "statement": "Each rhc setup step follows a check/apply pattern: check verifies if the service already has the required configuration, and apply makes changes only if the check fails. This ensures idempotent runs against already-configured services.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rhc.setup.consents.ts#L6-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1770c76ae797e17defed4568a81fd8d70333217173f89f5b5dc38126e349d1c3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://rhc.setup.ts#L8-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5d860e39173f205f20d4f615583c0320728a67db3d4847af331e9e5167765c21:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d66a1d1e210e4e0996df9cb0d738ab49",
      "statement": "The rhc setup tooling imports the same environment.dev.ts the app uses and derives server configuration from it, eliminating the problem of two lists that must agree but are kept in step by hand. Feature flags like emailRegistration, passwordReset, teamInvitations, and oauthLogin are mapped to corresponding server-side features.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rhc.setup.ts#L14-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:68d8e868e260c4cc3fbca5ddc744e5cc2926d2f70172aa34ad761cc5fb970de8:"
