    {
      "id": "claim_355e8ecd91564cb083e4e1578f4b06e1",
      "statement": "The consents gate (rhc.setup.consents.ts) adds a user schema validating consent fields, a permission for users to PATCH their own consents, JWT claims for latestConsents/tos and latestConsents/pp, and a guard rule blocking users who haven't accepted current versions. Version management uses TOS_VERSION and PP_VERSION constants.",
