    {
      "id": "claim_a5608e1515e44a37880d7a649b38f0eb",
      "statement": "The production build outputs to dist/restheart-cloud-starter-ng/ with browser/ for client assets and server/ for the SSR server bundle. The Express server in src/server.ts serves static files with 1-year cache, delegates other requests to AngularNodeAppEngine, and listens on PORT env var or defaults to 4000.",
