    {
      "id": "claim_8c4691255fd749e4a8dbfe6a0ea177af",
      "statement": "Two restyling paths exist: A) Tweak the skin by changing design tokens in section 1 and adjusting skin classes in sections 3-5 (~1 hour), or B) Adopt a UI framework by deleting sections 3-5 and reskinning templates using semantic class hooks (.card, .btn-primary, .form-field, .form-error, .success-msg, .muted, .badge).",
