    {
      "id": "claim_57e71360098b42e6aa30b7f1dc64f957",
      "statement": "PORTING.md is the authoritative guide for porting to other frameworks. The @restheart-cloud/kit and styles.css are 100% portable, templates need syntax adaptation but keep semantic class hooks, while kit-ng, routing, guards, and SSR must be rebuilt. Two easy-to-miss behaviors: checkSession() also loads teams, and login() loads teams in the same round trip.",
      "evidence": [
